{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-10-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN RELAUNCHES STREAMING MEASUREMENT SUITE ACROSS CONTENT, ADS AND PLATFORMS TO TACKLE GROWING CONSUMER SEGMENT', 'text': "NEW YORK, OCT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NIELSEN (NYSE: NLSN), A LONG TIME LEADER IN STREAMING CONTENT AND AD MEASUREMENT, ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS BRINGING ITS STREAMING SOLUTIONS TOGETHER IN A SINGLE MEASUREMENT SUITE \xa0ENCOMPASSING\xa0AD-SUPPORTED AND SUBSCRIPTION-BASED SERVICE MODELS ACROSS CONTENT, ADS AND PLATFORMS. NIELSEN'S RENEWED FOCUS ON COMPREHENSIVE STREAMING MEASUREMENT COMES AT A MOMENT WHEN U.S. CONSUMERS NOW SPEND OVER A QUARTER \xa0OF THEIR TOTAL TV TIME ENGAGING WITH THIS TYPE OF CONTENT."}